Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 16:35:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] ub:ubctl:Extract folders and modify file locations.

tool inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubctl/issues/27
CVE: NA

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Extract three folders
Place those involving protocol layers in the protocol_layer directory
Items related to individual function queries should be placed in the
feature directory
Place public items in the common directory

Signed-off-by: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
